===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Oddish|6}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion.
*'''Blot''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Heroes|Erika's Oddish|78}} from the {{TCG|Gym Heroes}} expansion.
